<PageTitle>What is gpsTrainer</PageTitle>
<h1>What is gpsTrainer?</h1>
<p>gpsTrainer is spoken coaching for a course you ride, run, or ski. The phone records the course. This site is where you edit it, mark intervals, and read race results.</p>
<p>Create an account with the same login the phone syncs. Build a course in the editor or record one on the phone. Download a race and stage at the start line.</p>
